@host = https://localhost:7080

### 1. Get all students
GET {{host}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 2. Search by name or enrollment number
GET {{host}}/api/students?search=aarav

### 3. Filter by department
GET {{host}}/api/students?department=Computer%20Engineering

### 4. Get one student by id
GET {{host}}/api/students/1

### 5. Create a student (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentNo": "92400136005",
  "fullName": "Karan Singh",
  "email": "karan.singh@example.com",
  "department": "Computer Engineering",
  "semester": 4
}

### 6. Invalid data (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentNo": "123",
  "fullName": "Ka",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "department": "",
  "semester": 12
}

### 7. Duplicate enrollment number (409 Conflict)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentNo": "92400133001",
  "fullName": "Duplicate Student",
  "email": "duplicate@example.com",
  "department": "Computer Engineering",
  "semester": 2
}

### 8. Update a student (200 OK)
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentNo": "92400133001",
  "fullName": "Aarav Mehta",
  "email": "aarav.mehta@example.com",
  "department": "Computer Engineering",
  "semester": 6
}

### 9. Delete a student (204 No Content)
DELETE {{host}}/api/students/3

### 10. Student that does not exist (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/students/99

### 11. Exception middleware demo (500 Internal Server Error)
GET {{host}}/api/students/test-error
